# 统一行尾：仓库内一律使用 LF，检出时由 Git 按平台处理
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式声明二进制文件，避免行尾转换与差异比较损坏内容
*.docx binary
*.doc binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary

# 语言与生成文件
*.md text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.js text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.css text
*.html text
